{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-fireworks#feature-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-fireworks","commit":"0bcd7208f400e75984296ad480586147ca53c82c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@weibaohui/dsh-fireworks** 的功能「事件驱动烟花」：监听会话创建、回合结束、工具结果、token 里程碑和待办完成事件，并映射到不同烟花类别。 通过 DSH 网页会话事件自动触发，效果显示在聊天页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:181-244"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-fireworks#feature-2","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-fireworks","commit":"0bcd7208f400e75984296ad480586147ca53c82c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@weibaohui/dsh-fireworks** 的功能「Token 缩放回合效果」：根据回合累计 token 数计算烟花规模；累计输出跨越设定档位时额外触发里程碑烟花。 通过 DSH 网页会话事件自动触发，效果显示在聊天页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:73-77","src/index.js:181-244"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-fireworks#feature-3","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-fireworks","commit":"0bcd7208f400e75984296ad480586147ca53c82c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@weibaohui/dsh-fireworks** 的功能「可配置网页浮层」：在聊天页面挂载透明画布，可设置显示区域、整体强度、类别开关，并提供试放控制。 通过 DSH 网页会话事件自动触发，效果显示在聊天页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.js:124-180"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-fireworks#feature-4","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-fireworks","commit":"0bcd7208f400e75984296ad480586147ca53c82c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@weibaohui/dsh-fireworks** 的功能「多路径粒子渲染」：引擎通过渲染器接口绘制烟花粒子，支持 WebGL2 累积拖尾并提供 Canvas2D 回退。 通过 DSH 网页会话事件自动触发，效果显示在聊天页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/engine.js:11-20","client/renderer-webgl.js:4-21","client/renderer-canvas2d.js:1-20"]}
